    m_Untranslated: '<b>1</b>.  In the <b>Project</b> window, open the <b>Assets</b> > <b>Prefabs</b> folder.


      <b>2</b>.  Drag the Moving_Platform prefab into the scene and position it at the edge of the <b>Ground</b> GameObject.


      <b>Note</b>: It doesn''t matter if the platform intersects with the <b>Ground</b> GameObejct.


      <b>3</b>.  Enter Play mode and use the platform to collect the star. '
  m_CriteriaCompletion: 0
  m_Criteria:
    m_Items: []
