    m_Untranslated: '<b >1</b>.  In the <b >Project</b> window, open the <b >Assets</b> > <b>UI</b> folder.


      <b>2</b>.  Click and drag the Remaining_Collectibles_UI asset into the <b>Hierarchy</b> window.


      <b>Note</b>: You won''t notice anything change in the <b>Scene</b> view.


      <b>3</b>.  Enter Play mode and check out the UI you just added.'
