  Text:
    m_Untranslated: 'Audio adds so much richness to a game experience!


      You''ll no doubt have noticed that the robot makes audible footsteps when it moves.


      The robot also has an <b>audio listener</b> attached to it, which works like ears. The audio listener makes it possible to experience <b>spatial audio</b>, where sounds come from particular sources in the scene.


      To really add a distinct feel to the scene, let''s add some background sound.'
