  Title:
    m_Untranslated: INSTRUCTIONS
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "<b >1</b>.  In the <b >Project</b> window, open the <b >Assets</b> > <b>VFX</b> folder.\n\n<b>2</b>.  Click and drag any of the VFX assets onto the ground in the scene.\n\n<b>3</b>.  In the <b>Inspector</b> window, change the <b>Position</b> coordinates as follows:\n\nX = 0 | Y = 0 | Z = 0 \n\n<b>4</b>.  Enter Play mode and check out the visual effect you just added."
  m_CriteriaCompletion: 0
  m_Criteria:
    m_Items: []
