  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "Animation is a key component of bringing a scene to life. Characters can have animations, like walking, running, or jumping. \n\nObjects in the scene can also be animated, like a tree swaying in the wind or a ball bouncing up and down.\n\nGameObjects can be animated using Unity's animation tools, or animations can be imported from other applications.\n"
